ode class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">02987bd0-554a-4cfc-af3f-78129c281618</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:02987bd0-554a-4cfc-af3f-78129c281618\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:02987bd0-554a-4cfc-af3f-78129c281618\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phoenix_Lubbins\" title=\"Phoenix Lubbins\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png/25px-Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png/38px-Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png/50px-Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phoenix Lubbins\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png/25px-Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Phoenix_Lubbins.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phoenix_Lubbins\" title=\"Phoenix Lubbins\">Phoenix Lubbins</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Judging by its many wrinkles, this note has been crumpled, unfolded, and re-crumpled countless times.]\n</p><p><br>\nDearest Lord Gortash, your almightiness, resplendent master of Baldur's Gate,\n</p><p><br>\nThanks to a punishment most just, I have come to know the error of my ways and the wrongness of my heart. I hereby renounce my previous alliances and vow my undying loyalty and service.\n</p><p><br>\nAs proof of my good faith, I am willing to offer you the names and locations of all gnomes I know who conspire against you. In your infinite wisdom and grace, I am certain you would reunite me with my husband Spanner in exchange.\n</p><p><br>\nWith grave sincerity,\n</p><p>Phoenix Lubbins\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715052955\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1857/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33345/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9257/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936289/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.067      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.067      1 -total\n 57.06%   25.717      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.35%   22.242     19 Template:Trim\n 21.84%    9.843      2 Template:Uid\n 16.63%    7.496      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.74%    6.642      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.55%    5.655      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.79%    4.861      1 Template:Notes\n 10.50%    4.732      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35114-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715052955 and revision id 365486. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}